{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>First-person combat and strategic summoning</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine a range of powerful weapons, destructive magic, and passive perks with summonable allies, artillery, and arcane towers to fight alongside you or control key points of the battlefield.<br>Mix and match your loadout to forge a playstyle that ranges from raw aggression, tactical control, or supernatural dominance in first-person combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133710/extras/1d9f4f8cfddc604775957b641422ed3c.poster.avif?t=1762906566\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133710/extras/1d9f4f8cfddc604775957b641422ed3c.webm?t=1762906566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Unique enemy capabilities</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly every foe within the Night Horde has their own unique abilities or traits. Some explode on death, others spawn reinforcements, heal their allies, freeze you in place, or cloud your senses. You\u2019ll need to adapt your strategy to survive their ever-shifting threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133710/extras/301b3c208cca55aac60f5de43524f151.poster.avif?t=1762906566\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133710/extras/301b3c208cca55aac60f5de43524f151.webm?t=1762906566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Dynamic hordes</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Night Horde strikes in escalating waves that grow larger, faster, and deadlier. A scalable spawning and AI system ensures that no two battles feel the same, capturing the chaos and intensity of a war against a nearly unending tide of creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133710/extras/c57bb02c2deae4454c1dcc8ef832b48a.poster.avif?t=1762906566\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133710/extras/c57bb02c2deae4454c1dcc8ef832b48a.webm?t=1762906566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Immersive dark atmosphere</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gothic eternal night brought to life through lighting and shadows. Each environment crafted to build tension and dread to a genre that rarely explores this direction.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133710/extras/5fac28295e9a367183c01ec7bd9a12b6.poster.avif?t=1762906566\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133710/extras/5fac28295e9a367183c01ec7bd9a12b6.webm?t=1762906566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Solo developed, AA scope</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built by a single developer with the ambition and polish of a larger team. <i>Sorrow Be The Night</i> pushes the boundaries of what one person can achieve, melding dark fantasy atmosphere with large scale, action focused tower defense.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4133710?t=1762906566","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4133710?t=1762906566","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133710/a3f90793172a8af6e51ab2b62a8b528f20eb07fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762906566","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133710/a3f90793172a8af6e51ab2b62a8b528f20eb07fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762906566","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Includes violence throughout with melee weapons, historical firearms, historical artillery weapons, and magic."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4150190,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>First-person combat and strategic summoning</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine a range of powerful weapons, destructive magic, and passive perks with summonable allies, artillery, and arcane towers to fight alongside you or control key points of the battlefield.<br>Mix and match your loadout to forge a playstyle that ranges from raw aggression, tactical contro